  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Digital economy in Palestine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;b&gt;The DEP project&lt;/b&gt; (Digital economy in Palestine) contributes to the sustainable development of the Palestinian economy and the creation of new employment opportunities in East Jerusalem, West Bank and Gaza by putting in place measures to support the development of a national digital economy : (1) Palestinian ICT sector creates new business opportunities; (2) The national digital ecosystem provides a scope of high-quality services; (3) The Palestinian citizens get access to more high-value income opportunities and (4) Coordination of the digital TEI.</narrative>
  </description>
